{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11309100","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11309100","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1130910001:1":{"text":"아니에요! 이제 먼저 공격하지 않아요!","source_cn":"不，区别可大了，它们现在不会主动攻击我们了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6E7C4629F323FAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130910002:1":{"text":"이제 상로도 원활하니 크림슨 고원으로 갈 수 있게 됐어.","source_cn":"这样一来，商路就畅通了，我们可以继续出发去深红高原了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B5748BC58B906C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1130910003:1":{"text":"그런데… 소문에 크림슨 고원에 이상하게 생긴 검은 몬스터가 나타났다고 하던데…","source_cn":"但我听说，深红高原有奇怪的黑色魔物……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3492544BBA7EE3FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1130910004:1":{"text":"잘 생각해 봐! 얼마 전에 난리였던 크림슨 고원의 보물은 결국 가짜였지? 그럼 몬스터에 대한 소문도 가짜일 확률이 높아! 뭐든 곧이곧대로 믿으면 어떻게 장사를 해?","source_cn":"好好想想，深红高原的宝藏是假的，那魔物传言也可能是假的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7AC5BF220CB5294D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:行商德博拉":{"text":"행상 데보라","source":"行商德博拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:行商乔瑟夫":{"text":"행상 조지프","source":"行商乔瑟夫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}